import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | TechPilot AI" description="Learn how TechPilot AI handles information, technical logs, cookies, and privacy questions.">
  <section class="page-hero"><span class="eyebrow">Legal information</span><h1>Privacy <span style="color:var(--mint)">policy.</span></h1><p>Last updated: October 16, 2026</p></section>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>This policy explains the information that may be processed when you visit TechPilot AI. The site publishes educational content about AI tools and technology.</p>
    <h2>Information you provide</h2>
    <p>If you email us, we receive the information and address you include in your message. We use it to read and respond to your request, consider corrections, and improve the site. Please avoid sending sensitive or confidential information unless it is necessary.</p>
    <h2>Technical information</h2>
    <p>Our hosting and security providers may process technical data such as IP address, browser information, requested URLs, and request timestamps in server or security logs. These records may be used to operate, protect, and troubleshoot the website, subject to provider practices and applicable requirements.</p>
    <h2>Cookies, analytics, and advertising</h2>
    <p>Site features may change over time. If analytics, advertising such as Google AdSense, or other third-party services are enabled, they may use cookies or similar technologies and process information under their own policies. This policy should be updated to describe any services actually enabled and the choices available to visitors before they are introduced.</p>
    <h2>Third-party links</h2>
    <p>Our articles may link to external websites or AI tools. Those services operate independently and have their own privacy policies. Review those policies before providing information to them.</p>
    <h2>Retention and security</h2>
    <p>We aim to keep email correspondence only for as long as reasonably needed to respond, maintain relevant records, and meet applicable obligations. No online service can guarantee absolute security.</p>
    <h2>Your privacy questions</h2>
    <p>For privacy-related questions or requests, contact <a href="mailto:contact1techpilotai@gmail.com">contact1techpilotai@gmail.com</a>. We will review requests in accordance with applicable law.</p>
    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy as the website or its services change. The date at the top indicates the latest revision.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
